      "text": "{{dad}} , I'm sorry, I just...",
      "character": 1
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "text",
      "order": 4,
      "probability": 100,
      "styleClass": [],
      "text": "Easy, I’m not here to scold. Your {{mom}} and I both understand what you’re going through. Actually, I brought something that might work better than a photo.",
      "character": 3
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "text",
      "order": 5,
      "probability": 100,
      "styleClass": [],
      "text": "He retrieves a small, plain USB stick from his pocket. The way he holds it — deliberate, almost ceremonial — tells you this is more than just a file. He places it in your palm and closes your fingers around it.",
      "character": 500
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "text",
      "order": 6,
      "probability": 100,
      "styleClass": [],
      "text": "What am I supposed to do with this?",
      "character": 1
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "text",
      "order": 7,
      "probability": 100,
      "styleClass": [],
      "text": "It’s a home video. Your {{mom}} and me.When your hand starts wandering where it shouldn’t, you watch this. It’s your pressure valve.",
      "character": 3
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "text",
      "order": 8,
      "probability": 100,
      "styleClass": [],
      "text": "But taking this... doesn’t it make me... worse?",
      "character": 1
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "text",
      "order": 9,
      "probability": 100,
      "styleClass": [],
      "text": "It makes you a kid with a {{dad}} who’s got your back. Just remember: your {{mom}} can never, ever know this exists.",
      "character": 3
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "text",
      "order": 10,
      "probability": 100,
      "styleClass": [],
      "text": "...Okay. Our secret.",
      "character": 1
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "text",
      "order": 11,
      "probability": 100,
      "styleClass": [],
